sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 actor U as Verified user
 participant API as GET /api/v1/parties/{id}/members
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 Note over U,DB: API implemented, dedicated member-list UI integration is pending
 U->>API: Session GET
 API->>API: University guard and GET-only check
 alt Invalid session / identity / method
 API-->>U: 401 / 403 / 405
 else Valid request
 API->>DB: Find Party and check Host or active membership
 alt Missing Party or forbidden viewer
 API-->>U: 404 / 403
 else Authorized
 API->>DB: Active memberships + user/profile, order joined_at then pk
 API->>API: Stable Host-first sort, fallback display_name
 API-->>U: 200 members(user_id, display_name, role), member_count, no-store
 Note over API,DB: Only actual active rows, never synthesize Host, no email/student ID
 end
 end
